OL,3,GNEWSAUrban explorers at empty hotel
OL,4,Acould be arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrespassers breaking into the empty
OL,7,Fsite of a seaside hotel risk being
OL,8,Farrested after a closure order was put
OL,9,Fin place to tackle anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour.
OL,12,FNorth Somerset Council sought the order
OL,13,Ffor the Grand Atlantic Hotel in
OL,14,FWeston-super-Mare after repeated
OL,15,Fbreak-ins since its closure for a
OL,16,Fmulti-million pound revamp in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
