OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1792502781
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAUrban explorers at empty hotel
OL,4,Acould be arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FIssued by North Somerset Magistrates'
OL,7,FCourt and the first of its kind
OL,8,Fobtained by the council, the order
OL,9,Fmeans it is now a criminal offence for
OL,10,Fanyone other than the owner or
OL,11,Fauthorised agents to enter the site.
OL,13,FThe council said the anti-social
OL,14,Fbehaviour at the "extremely dangerous"
OL,15,Fformer hotel had caused "alarm and
OL,16,Fdistress" to local businesses and
OL,17,Fresidents.
